\f0\fs24 \cf0 Unity Realtime Companion (GPT-4o mini) \'96 Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) Build Guide\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

\f1\b \cf0 Goal:
\f0\b0  Create an always-on, voice + text, emotionally aware companion in Unity that can ground its responses in 
\f2\i your own knowledge base
\f0\i0  (docs, FAQs, user journaling, health data, design files, etc.) using Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) while streaming realtime responses from OpenAI 
\f1\b 4o-mini Realtime
\f0\b0 .\
