\cf0 3.3 Chunking Strategy\
Good RAG \uc0\u8776  good chunks. Target ~400-800 tokens raw, but store 
\f2\i semantic sentences
\f0\i0  + 
\f2\i structured metadata
\f0\i0 .\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls5\ilvl0\cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Use sentence segmentation.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Sliding window overlap (10\'9620%) to preserve context.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Include doc title + section heading as synthetic leading text in each chunk.\
{\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Compute word count & token estimate; store both.\
\pard\pardeftab720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
