4.1 Pipeline Stages\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Collect Sources
\f0\b0  (filesystem, CMS, Notion export, Google Docs API, transcripts, CSV).\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Clean & Normalize
\f0\b0  (strip HTML, unify whitespace, language detection).\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Chunk
\f0\b0  (size + overlap; attach metadata).\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Embed
\f0\b0  (batch through embeddings API; store vector + metadata).\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Index
\f0\b0  (insert into vector DB; optionally add full-text inverted index for hybrid search).\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Test Retrieval
\f0\b0  (ad-hoc queries; relevance judgement; recall/precision grid search topK & similarity threshold).\
