11. Latency & Cost Controls\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0
\ls11\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Two-Stage Retrieval:
\f0\b0  cheap keyword pre-filter 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  vector re-rank.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Adaptive top-K:
\f0\b0  8 results for short queries; 3 for long transcripts; trim by token count.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Async Prefetch:
\f0\b0  For long user monologues, start retrieval after first 2 seconds of transcript partial text.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Embedding Cache:
\f0\b0  SHA256(text) 
\f3 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  embedding; skip duplicates.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Cold-start preload:
\f0\b0  Pre-embed high-frequency FAQ; warm into memory.\
\ls11\ilvl0
\f1\b {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}Delta Contexting:
\f0\b0  Only re-send changed knowledge blocks to Realtime session when new results differ >30% Jaccard.\
